## The Lantern at First Light

::bg{location="skerry_lantern" time="morning"}
<match on="run.weather">
  <when is="gale">
    @narrator: The gale has not blown itself out. Spray rattles on the lantern glass a hundred feet up.
  </when>
  <when is="fog">
    @narrator: Fog in the night. The rock is an island on an island, and the foghorn has been groaning since four.
  </when>
  <when is="clear">
    @narrator: The sea has gone flat and innocent, as if it never did anything to anyone.
  </when>
</match>
@inspector{mono}: {{clock.weekdayLabel}}. One more day before the Board wants my report. Hollis will bring whoever is willing to talk.
@inspector{mono,when="holds(liar(maren))"}: And Maren Hale has some explaining to do.
